      "updated": 1714701337654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "this inner loop will check each tail if it's\nnot visited. if it's not visited AND that tail\nis lesser than the CURRENT minWeight,\nthen update the current minWeight to the\nnew lesser minWeight. In order to keep track\nof the pair of edges with the lesser minWeight,\nwe assign integer variables u and v to\nhead and tail respectively.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this inner loop will check each tail if it's\nnot visited. if it's not visited AND that tail\nis lesser than the CURRENT minWeight,\nthen update the current minWeight to the\nnew lesser minWeight. In order to keep track\nof the pair of edges with the lesser minWeight,\nwe assign integer variables u and v to\nhead and tail respectively.",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
