      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1) get a startingPoint then enqueue that startingPoint\n2) get all adjacent vertices with your current startingPoint while adding them to queue\n3) after your current startingPoint has no more adjacent vertices, dequeue it\nand move on to the next starting point from your queue.\n4) repeat the steps 2-3",
