      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "basically, loops through your entire matrix\nand checks for pair of vertices that has the\nleast minWeight. Once it has the final\nminWeight, we also have the index information\nof the pair of vertices (u, v).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "basically, loops through your entire matrix\nand checks for pair of vertices that has the\nleast minWeight. Once it has the final\nminWeight, we also have the index information\nof the pair of vertices (u, v).",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
