    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1683,
      "versionNonce": 1313345132,
      "index": "bhI",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "tzFn8TZXIOFswI7zHvb-J",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 9062.650308052138,
      "y": 3732.885408182013,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 985.263671875,
      "height": 160.99999999999997,
      "seed": 166055892,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1714917380441,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "These two statements are important. We set the pair of vertices (u, v) to INF so\nthat upon the next iteration of getting the next and new pair of vertices with their\nlesser minWeight, the PAST PAIR OF VERTICES will NOT BE EVALUATED.\nOtherwise, we would always go back to comparing the same vertices over and\nover again.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "These two statements are important. We set the pair of vertices (u, v) to INF so\nthat upon the next iteration of getting the next and new pair of vertices with their\nlesser minWeight, the PAST PAIR OF VERTICES will NOT BE EVALUATED.\nOtherwise, we would always go back to comparing the same vertices over and\nover again.",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "twpoZotOMQdGrqVEbMpAz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4649.074831730331,
      "y": 1763.8397746510207,
      "width": 958.6171875,
      "height": 676.1999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 244354265,
      "version": 75,
      "versionNonce": 1051260569,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714918066747,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "void DFS (Graph main, int startingPoint, set visited){\n\n        \n        \n        visited[startingPoint] = 1;\n\n        \n\n        List trav;\n        \n\n        printf(\"%d -> \", startingPoint);\n\n\n\n        for (trav = main.headers[startingPoint] ; trav != NULL ; trav = trav->next){\n                if (!visited[trav->vertex]){\n                        DFS(main, trav->vertex, visited);\n                }\n        }\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "void DFS (Graph main, int startingPoint, set visited){\n\n        \n        \n        visited[startingPoint] = 1;\n\n        \n\n        List trav;\n        \n\n        printf(\"%d -> \", startingPoint);\n\n\n\n        for (trav = main.headers[startingPoint] ; trav != NULL ; trav = trav->next){\n                if (!visited[trav->vertex]){\n                        DFS(main, trav->vertex, visited);\n                }\n        }\n}",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "y_BQ89b0n_CDFONNJhbIc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4712.772829024046,
      "y": 1796.6620381656994,
      "width": 1025.63671875,
      "height": 96.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1393271033,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 1840629527,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714917843593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we always set our visited array at the index of our chosen vertex starting point to 1.\nThe reason for this is that in DFS or in any Graph Traversal method, you have the\nliberty to choose at which vertex you want to traverse your graph.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we always set our visited array at the index of our chosen vertex starting point to 1.\nThe reason for this is that in DFS or in any Graph Traversal method, you have the\nliberty to choose at which vertex you want to traverse your graph.",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "PZ9gMzhPVS-VXf9vfiOe4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4712.772829024046,
      "y": 1924.5546249267807,
      "width": 692.53515625,
      "height": 96.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1041314873,
      "version": 754,
      "versionNonce": 1307969495,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714917896459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Always remember, the reason why we have a Bit-Vector\nImplementation of a Set is so that we keep track of the\nvertices that we have visited so far.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Always remember, the reason why we have a Bit-Vector\nImplementation of a Set is so that we keep track of the\nvertices that we have visited so far.",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "9ztPawPIjnuQhocxGS29J",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4712.7728290240475,
      "y": 2051.4783284548234,
      "width": 665.533203125,
      "height": 64.39999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 161498135,
      "version": 1162,
      "versionNonce": 310832345,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714917974127,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We declare a trav variable since DFS is implemented \nvia Parent-Pointer Implementation (PPI)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We declare a trav variable since DFS is implemented \nvia Parent-Pointer Implementation (PPI)",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "2OSKmetLySaqxJOqCBBxJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4709.866179324932,
      "y": 2150.30441822475,
      "width": 1015.4921875,
      "height": 96.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1258544503,
      "version": 1578,
      "versionNonce": 1036786041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714919160958,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For every recursive call of DFS, let trav point to the new startingPoint. If the vertex\nat trav->vertex is not yet visited, call DFS once again on that new unvisited vertex,\nwhich would make it the new starting point at the next recursive call. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For every recursive call of DFS, let trav point to the new startingPoint. If the vertex\nat trav->vertex is not yet visited, call DFS once again on that new unvisited vertex,\nwhich would make it the new starting point at the next recursive call. ",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "pEqtIMv2vAeu3pt5aW0Dm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5975.835995937774,
      "y": 1766.8180028526353,
      "width": 1185.419921875,
      "height": 1094.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1740669721,
      "version": 290,
      "versionNonce": 538645721,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714932541414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "set* Dijkstras(graphType C, int start) {\n    set *smallestCosts = (set*)malloc(sizeof(int) * MAX);\n    set visited = {0}; \n    int count;\n    int x, y;\n\n    if (smallestCosts != NULL) {\n\n        for (x = 0; x < MAX; x++) {\n            (*smallestCosts)[x] = INF;\n        }\n\n        (*smallestCosts)[start] = 0;\n  \n        for (x = 0; x < MAX; x++) {\n            int minIndex = -1;\n            for (y = 0; y < MAX; y++) {\n                if (!visited[y] && (minIndex == -1 || (*smallestCosts)[y] < (*smallestCosts)[minIndex])) {\n                    minIndex = y;\n                }\n            }\n            visited[minIndex] = 1;\n            for (y = 0; y < MAX; y++) {\n                if (!visited[y] && C[minIndex][y] != INF) {\n                    if ((*smallestCosts)[minIndex] + C[minIndex][y] < (*smallestCosts)[y]) {\n                        (*smallestCosts)[y] = (*smallestCosts)[minIndex] + C[minIndex][y];\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    return smallestCosts;\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "set* Dijkstras(graphType C, int start) {\n    set *smallestCosts = (set*)malloc(sizeof(int) * MAX);\n    set visited = {0}; \n    int count;\n    int x, y;\n\n    if (smallestCosts != NULL) {\n\n        for (x = 0; x < MAX; x++) {\n            (*smallestCosts)[x] = INF;\n        }\n\n        (*smallestCosts)[start] = 0;\n  \n        for (x = 0; x < MAX; x++) {\n            int minIndex = -1;\n            for (y = 0; y < MAX; y++) {\n                if (!visited[y] && (minIndex == -1 || (*smallestCosts)[y] < (*smallestCosts)[minIndex])) {\n                    minIndex = y;\n                }\n            }\n            visited[minIndex] = 1;\n            for (y = 0; y < MAX; y++) {\n                if (!visited[y] && C[minIndex][y] != INF) {\n                    if ((*smallestCosts)[minIndex] + C[minIndex][y] < (*smallestCosts)[y]) {\n                        (*smallestCosts)[y] = (*smallestCosts)[minIndex] + C[minIndex][y];\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    return smallestCosts;\n}",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "S5eDI3O52OvtDE2QF6U-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7332.5862710695965,
      "y": 1801.1766827760605,
      "width": 771.654296875,
      "height": 837.1999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "biI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 612933655,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 1599471863,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714918681507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "graphType* FloydAlgo(graphType A){\n        int x, y, z;\n        graphType* C = (graphType*)malloc(sizeof(graphType));\n        if (C != NULL){\n\n                \n                memcpy(*C, A, sizeof(graphType));\n\n                for (x = 0 ; x < MAX ; x++){\n                        (*C)[x][x] = 0;\n                }\n                \n\n\n                for (x = 0 ; x < MAX ; x++){\n                        for (y = 0 ; y < MAX ; y++){\n                                for (z = 0 ; z < MAX ; z++){\n                                        if ((*C)[y][x] + (*C)[x][z] < (*C)[y][z]){\n                                                (*C)[y][z] = (*C)[y][x] + (*C)[x][z];\n                                        }\n                                }\n                        }                        \n                }\n        }\n        return C;\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "graphType* FloydAlgo(graphType A){\n        int x, y, z;\n        graphType* C = (graphType*)malloc(sizeof(graphType));\n        if (C != NULL){\n\n                \n                memcpy(*C, A, sizeof(graphType));\n\n                for (x = 0 ; x < MAX ; x++){\n                        (*C)[x][x] = 0;\n                }\n                \n\n\n                for (x = 0 ; x < MAX ; x++){\n                        for (y = 0 ; y < MAX ; y++){\n                                for (z = 0 ; z < MAX ; z++){\n                                        if ((*C)[y][x] + (*C)[x][z] < (*C)[y][z]){\n                                                (*C)[y][z] = (*C)[y][x] + (*C)[x][z];\n                                        }\n                                }\n                        }                        \n                }\n        }\n        return C;\n}",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "EuCZkxymZC4gVRRaAe4bL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7456.298983491977,
      "y": 1933.9554509528064,
      "width": 698.783203125,
      "height": 64.39999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "biJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 280382137,
      "version": 1850,
      "versionNonce": 884185431,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1714918536784,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Copy all contents of your graph in main() into your newly\nallocated and empty graph.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Copy all contents of your graph in main() into your newly\nallocated and empty graph.",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "aazZdnxwUGRtd7angGwCt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7801.607565527745,
      "y": 2058.197992876346,
      "width": 476.24609375,
      "height": 96.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
